      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this wonderful three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached family home with a highly sought after south west facing rear garden to the market in the ever popular Bellingfield development, Naas. The location is second to none as you are almost right in the heart of Naas town centre with primary & secondary schools, shops, restaurants and a host of sports & leisure facilities virtually on your doorstep. In a couple of minutes' drive you will find the N7 motorway making this the perfect commuter town to Dublin, Sallins train station is also within a 10 minute drive away. There is a lovely playground within the development with a 3km walking trail and you also have local access to the Killashee Hotel. \r\n\r\nBright, airy and most stylish internal living accommodation of c. 121 sqm consists of entrance hallway with plenty of space under the stairs, guest bathroom, large living room with stunning feature wall, beautiful fully fitted kitchen and separate utility room to the rear. On the first floor you have three spacious bedrooms (one master ensuite), all rooms have the benefit of top-quality built-in wardrobes and main family bathroom. To the rear of the property you have a fully enclosed & private garden of the lowest maintenance with a sunny south west facing orientation making it perfect for relaxing on them long sunny summer evenings with the use of a block-built unit which can be used for so many different purposes whilst the front provides ample off-street parking on a maintenance free driveway. \r\n\r\nNo. 50 The Avenue, Bellingsfield is situated in one of Naas most sought-after developments and comes to the market in turnkey condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years & comes to the market with plenty of additional features such as A2 energy rated, large living space, stunning feature wall, air to water heating system and top-quality fixtures & fittings to name but a few. \r\n\r\nThis property truly needs to be viewed to appreciate the fantastic home on offer, we expect this to be really popular with first time buyers looking to get on the property ladder or any family looking to settle roots in this fantastic community. \r\n\r\nCall Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n- c. 121 sqm \r\n- BER A2 \r\n- 3 bed / 3 bath \r\n- Semi-detached family home\r\n- Only 6 years old \r\n- Extra spacious living \r\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom \r\n- Turnkey condition throughout\r\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings \r\n- Entrance hallway \r\n- Ample space under the stairs \r\n- Guest bathroom \r\n- Large living room \r\n- Stunning feature wall \r\n- Beautiful fully fitted kitchen\r\n- Integrated appliances \r\n- Separate utility room \r\n- Three generous bedrooms\r\n- Built in wardrobes\r\n- Master ensuite \r\n- Main family bathroom\r\n- Ample storage \r\n- Top quality flooring throughout \r\n- Beautiful rear garden \r\n- Private & fully enclosed \r\n- Very low maintenance \r\n- Block built unit to the rear \r\n- Sunny south west facing rear \r\n- Perfect for summer dining \r\n- Ample parking to the front \r\n- Maintenance free driveway \r\n- Double glazed PVC windows\r\n- Air to water heating \r\n- Water pressure pump \r\n- Family oriented development\r\n- Family playground within the development \r\n- 3km walking trail \r\n- Local access to the Killashee Hotel \r\n- Perfect for first time buyers & growing families \r\n- Close to all local amenities \r\n- Viewing is highly advised. \r\n\r\nDirections - W91 R68D"
      },
      {
